  "id": "three-way-interaction",
  "term": "three-way interaction",
  "definition": "A three-way interaction is a combined effect in which the relationship between two factors changes depending on a third factor. In the packet’s example, the impact of a leader’s emotional expression and a member’s positive mood differed depending on the quality of the leader-member relationship.",
